+//! Predecessor-only bond policy and connector for threshold research v3.
+//!
+//! Construction is split deliberately. [`ThresholdV3BondPolicyP0`] commits
+//! static scripts, principals, values, and the complete threshold registry but
+//! contains no transaction ids. It therefore derives bond scripts without a
+//! cycle. [`ThresholdV3FundedSetupP1`] subsequently binds the exact prospective
+//! Contest `C_i` and bond `B_i` outpoints and transaction outputs. Descendant
+//! resolution, ACK, and timeout transactions may consume P1, but neither P0
+//! nor P1 contains descendant ids or sighashes.
+
